        (^{:inst [(* go.crypto.internal.fips140.nistec/P384Point)]} ecdh/ECDH (ecdh/P384) priv pub)))))








^{:go/end 211} (go/func P521 "P521 returns a [Curve] which implements NIST P-521 (FIPS 186-3, section D.2.5),\nalso known as secp521r1.\n\nMultiple invocations of this function will return the same value, which can\nbe used for equality checks and switch statements.\n" ^Curve [] p521)

